    <briefdescription>
<para>Represents a temporary file. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para>The temporary file must be eventually discarded or given a final name and kept.</para>
<para>The destructor doesn&apos;t implicitly discard because there is no way to properly handle errors in a destructor. </para>
    </detaileddescription>
